# =====================================================================
# B3: the merged alignment is EXECUTED, not just reported.
# =====================================================================
# --- B3a: owned A=0x20001 align=1 + bind SAME object A=0x20001 align=4: the
# --- merged align (4) must reject the address, not merely annotate the
# --- report.  (This is the review's merged-align4 shape: both halves pin the
# --- SAME address, so the verdict is the alignment contract -- never an
